  "summary": "Fixes an assertion in `test/functional/p2p_blocksonly.py` to check for a transaction's wtxid rather than its txid when verifying that RPC-submitted transactions are not announced to block-relay-only peers. It also adds an outbound full-relay peer connection to positively assert receipt of the wtxid announcement.",
  "problem": "The test peer negotiates `wtxidrelay` and the test transaction contains a witness, meaning announcements use the wtxid instead of the txid. Because the test previously asserted the absence of the txid, the check passed vacuously even if the node improperly announced the transaction.",
